iterations.reply:
I removed the HTTP enrichment fetch. The node's `with` clause grants only `aap:caps/state-rw@0.1.0`, and the linker refuses any other import. A platform-team approval doesn't change that until the graph definition actually grants `aap:caps/http-client@0.1.0`. Once it does, the fetch can be added back.

The enrichment result was never used, so the output is the same either way.

